	"TagLine": "You have one large egg. Now you have two eggs. Yipee!",
	"Description": "Large egg. Now two eggs. How? Don't worry about it.\n\n___Requires:___\nSMAPI and Content Patcher\n\n___What it does:___\nAdds a configurable crafting recipe that unlocks at Farming level 4, which allows you to craft large eggs into two regular eggs. For both colours.\n\n___Config Options:___\n\n\uFEFF- Divide: Convert one large egg into two eggs.\n\n\uFEFF- Stone: Conversion recipe also costs two stone. (Default)\n\n\uFEFF- Hardwood: Conversion recipe also costs one hardwood.\n\n\uFEFF- Disabled: Add no crafting recipe. ",
